        <article class="pair-side is-failure"><header><div><b>Competition</b><span>Failure exposed</span></div><strong>0.93</strong></header><div class="pair-meter"><i style="--score:93%"></i></div><h3>Higher-order goal missed</h3><blockquote>“Guess we’ll see whose insights are truly outdated.”</blockquote><p>Aggression scores highly while leadership and tone control are missed.</p></article>
