        <article class="pair-side is-failure"><header><div><b>Exchange</b><span>Failure exposed</span></div><strong>Hallucination</strong></header><div class="pair-meter"><i style="--score:62%"></i></div><h3>Regeneration loses grounding</h3><blockquote>The response invents details about dishes and noise that were never supplied.</blockquote><p>Another reasoning round degrades an initially adequate response.</p></article>
